 <h3><u>Khoon e haider</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haye ali, haye haye ali..(2)<br> Behta hai khoon e haider, koofe mein karbala mein<br> Zehra ka ghar luta hai, haaye rahe khuda mein<br> koofe mein karbala mein<br> behta hai...</p> 
  <p>1. Ek fajr par hai sajda, ek sajda asr par hai<br> ek simt par hai beta, ek simt pe padar hai<br> kya fark hai batao, dono pe is jafa mein<br> koofe mein karbala mein<br> behta hai...</p> 
  <p>2. Koofe mein murtaza ki, beti pe hai yatimi<br> shabbir ki yatima, karbobala mein ujdi<br> hai zainab o sakina, ek dard ki fiza mein<br> koofe mein karbala mein<br> behta hai...</p> 
  <p>3. Kulsoom aur zainab, padhti rahi hai nauha<br> baba ko zakhmi dekha, bhai ko zakhmi dekha<br> manzar hai ek jaisa, is dehr e bewafa mein<br> koofe mein karbala mein<br> behta hai...</p> 
  <p>4. Maloom tha ali ko, sajda na hoga pura<br> sarwar ko bhi pata hai, ab aakhri hai sajda<br> sar ko jhukaya phir bhi, taazeem e kibriya mein<br> koofe mein karbala mein<br> behta hai...</p> 
  <p>5. Haye, qasim ke ho wo tukde, ya ho gulu e asghar<br> akbar ka ho wo seena, ya baazu e dilawar<br> imraa'n ka khoo'n baha hai, haye bughze murtaza mein<br> koofe mein karbala mein<br> behta hai...</p> 
  <p>6. Salmaan aur meesum, tareekh hai batati<br> guzri hai zindagi bas, aulad e sayyeda ki<br> matam mein murtaza ke, shabbir ki azaa mein<br> koofe mein karbala mein<br> behta hai...<br> koofe mein karbala mein..(2)</p> 
